# Jace's Machinations: "until end of turn, you may activate loyalty abilities of Jace planeswalkers you control on any
# player's turn any time you could cast an instant" (CR 606.3, 611.2c), then empower Jace 8.
#
# Bot1 casts Jace, the Mind Sculptor on turn one and does not activate it. In Bot2's upkeep on turn two Bot1 casts the
# Machinations: it makes a Jace token with 8 loyalty. Still in Bot2's upkeep, Bot1 activates the Mind Sculptor's +2 (on
# the opponent's turn, outside a main phase). Once it has resolved, the stack is empty and Bot1 has priority again, but
# no second loyalty ability of the Mind Sculptor is offered: one per permanent each turn still holds (ruling: "You may
# still activate only one loyalty ability of each permanent you control during the turn"). Then Bot2 casts Lightning
# Bolt at Bot1, and Bot1 answers it with the Jace token's -3 - a planeswalker that entered this turn, with the Bolt on the
# stack - which resolves first and draws.

